Apple2Forge: 16K Language Card (slot 0) for a2emu, so the emulated Apple II+
has 64K. Soft switches $C080-$C08F, two $D000 banks, $E000-$FFFF RAM.
Apply after a2emu-require-rom.patch. Pinned: e095c14ae7fd51fb638e14d5f9667ba6b19f945b.

